{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-11-01 08:58:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES ANNOUNCES CASH TENDER OFFERS', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS., NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORP. (NYSE:\xa0 RTX) ("RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES" OR "RTC") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED CASH TENDER OFFERS (EACH, AN "OFFER" AND COLLECTIVELY, THE "OFFERS") FOR THE MAXIMUM PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF VALIDLY TENDERED (AND NOT VALIDLY WITHDRAWN) NOTES SET FORTH BELOW (THE "NOTES"), SUCH THAT THE AGGREGATE PURCHASE PRICE, NOT INCLUDING ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST, PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF SUCH NOTES WILL NOT EXCEED $2.1 BILLION.'}